      "en": "“‘All the days that he separates himself to the LORD he shall not go near a dead body.",
      "ko": "자기 몸을 구별하여 여호와께 드리는 모든 날 동안은 시체를 가까이 하지 말 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "7933d7a441460c3341267119e4881faf630005acda145c6c2ef534fac6b281de",
      "translation_text_hash": "84f4be4abbc5e9233b770551a7d86de1c0f2ef3c378c9c6a944c06a8cf2636db",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
